  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Rehabilitation of agricultural infrastructure to assist farmers that lost agricultural instulation due to Israeli army incursions. Result is to provide farmers with instruments to continue farming and livelhood.2. Access to food for females household with the aim of self reliance and support of theer families. Results target group will not fall into poverty.</narrative>
